{"unit_id":"NOirBRight__dsh-model-switch#card-zh","repo":"NOirBRight/dsh-model-switch","commit":"e4836acd5154db3d547e2b43669a79a792e03140","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Model Switch 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的模型路由插件。它连接 DSH 默认模型服务，并提供设置面板、Composer Picker 与 Plan Review 选模界面。用户可设置新会话的 Main 模型、为子代理选择跟随主路由或固定路由、切换当前会话模型，也可选择 Plan 执行模型。插件还挂接搜索和图像生成适配器，并在发送前检查切换模型后的上下文容量。适合需要管理多种模型路由的 DSH 用户；provider 及凭据由对应插件提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host-runtime.ts:20-56","src/client/index.tsx:24-40","src/subagent-runtime.ts:35-60"]}
{"unit_id":"NOirBRight__dsh-model-switch#card-en","repo":"NOirBRight/dsh-model-switch","commit":"e4836acd5154db3d547e2b43669a79a792e03140","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Model Switch adds model routing to DeepSeek Harness web. Set the default for new sessions, route subagents through the parent or a fixed model, switch the active session model, and choose a Plan execution model. Optional search and image adapters are supported.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host-runtime.ts:20-56","src/client/index.tsx:24-40","src/subagent-runtime.ts:35-60"]}
